<Layout title="Disclaimer">
    <section class="disclaimer-section">
        <h2 class="text-teal-400 my-1.5">Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
            FossilGeo provides geographic and geological information on a best-effort basis. Data availability depends on regional coverage and third-party
            sources. While FossilGeo is primarily focused on the United Kingdom, information for other regions may be available where supported.
        </p>
        <p>
            Please note that geographic data may be limited or unavailable for certain locations due to data restrictions, incomplete datasets, or poor mobile
            connectivity. FossilGeo cannot guarantee the completeness, accuracy, or timeliness of the information provided.
        </p>
        <p>
            Users are responsible for verifying any information before relying on it for scientific, educational, or decision-making purposes. FossilGeo and its
            contributors accept no liability for any loss or damage resulting from the use of this app or website.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you experience issues accessing data, please check your internet connection or try again later. For more details on data sources and coverage,
            see our <a href="/data-policy">Data Policy</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2.5 italic">&copy; 2025 FossilGeo. All rights reserved.</p>
    </section>
</Layout>
